      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problem:\nGiven a 10-digit ISBN number, determine whether it is\nvalid.\n\nRule:\nMultiply each digit by its position (1 to 10), add all the\nproducts, and if the total sum is divisible by 11, the\nISBN is valid; otherwise, it is invalid.\n\nNote:\nIf the input does not contain exactly 10 digits, it is\nconsidered invalid.",
      "fontSize": 50.19574940065488,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problem:\nGiven a 10-digit ISBN number, determine whether it is valid.\n\nRule:\nMultiply each digit by its position (1 to 10), add all the products, and if the total sum is divisible by 11, the ISBN is valid; otherwise, it is invalid.\n\nNote:\nIf the input does not contain exactly 10 digits, it is considered invalid.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
